Tera Term macro test corpus
===========================

The *.ttl files in this directory are Tera Term's own macro tests, copied
verbatim from

    https://github.com/TeraTermProject/teraterm/tree/main/tests
    commit 1a6c34d0295bf07262bcbf5071dd2dcf847eea2a  (2026-10-27)
    retrieved 2026-11-01

Only the *.ttl files are copied. The shell, Perl and Ruby scripts beside them in
upstream's tests/ directory exercise the terminal rather than the language, and
are not vendored. The files are unmodified, encodings included: 15 are CP932, one
is UTF-16BE and one is UTF-16LE, and that variety is part of what they test
(manual §3.1).

